 \end{enumerate}
 
-These predictions are qualitative, and the framework does not yet specify the
-functional forms that would make them quantitative. Establishing those forms is
-the principal item on the research agenda set out in
-Section~\ref{sec:future}.
-
-A reference implementation of the five forces, together with a simulation of the
-four predictions stated above, is openly available in the repository accompanying
-this article \citep{Hamam2026GitHub}. Each force is instantiated as an explicit
-function of a policy and an environment state, and each prediction is evaluated
-against a comparator drawn from the accounts discussed in this section---a
-fixed-weight scalarization for (H1), a per-episode objective for (H2), a monotone
